title: GOES–MRMS Convection Initiation Nowcasting
message: >-
  If you use this code, cite this repository and the accompanying manuscript:
  Spatially Explicit Deep Learning Nowcasting of Convection Initiation Using
  GOES and MRMS. Publication metadata will be added when available.
